1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,850
She unlocks a door nobody is waiting behind.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:08,050
Every light in the room. Even the one over her desk.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,350
The wheel has squeaked since 2019. She's never fixed it.

4
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:22,300
Nobody comes before ten.

5
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:25,900
She opens at seven.
